-<input>T3C.3 (sizing posture), T3C.5 (concentration); CP-2A downside pathways, CP-2D liquidity bridge, CP-3A recovery sensitivity, CP-4/CP-4A legal findings.</input>
-<gate>Step 6 complete.</gate>
